              "name": "Cheri"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sorry, I get the 'shakes' whenever I see sugar in a recipe. It has ZERO nutritional value and we consume far to much of it without realizing it. Therefore, you can substitute honey in a 1:2 ratio (in this case, 2 tsps) or less and make this VERY delicious and nutritional."
